{
 "feature": "Teleport to Quest (marker / monster target)",
 "notes": "Quest target position is NOT stored as a Vector3 anywhere statically. Chain at runtime: QuestManager.currentQuest @0x30 -> Quest.targetAreaNode @0x20 (NavigationNode: sceneName @0x28, areaName @0x30 — NO position field) -> the scene's QuestMarkerNode GameObject -> its Transform (IInteractableNode.get_transform RVA 0x25CA0D0) -> Transform.get_position (0x4FDBDF4). Teleport = write that Vector3 into the player Transform via Transform.set_position (0x4FDBEC8). Monster-target teleport: Objective.enemy (EnemyReference @0x18) identifies the monster type; the live enemy Transform must be found in the scene at runtime. Quest.disableTeleportation @0x50 may block the built-in teleport — the injector's direct Transform write bypasses it. DYNAMIC VERIFICATION ON DEVICE IS REQUIRED before shipping this feature.",
